  (lib_symbols)
  (text "Block 1: CM5 mating connectors\n\n- Two 100-pin board-to-board connectors (J_GPIO pins 1-100, J_HSS pins 101-200)\n- Mating part and stack height: UNVERIFIED. Secondary source lists Amphenol 10164227-1001A1RLF;\n  confirm part, stack height and orientation against RP-008180-DS.\n- Unverified pin table for cross-check only: ../research/cm5_connector_pins_UNVERIFIED.csv\n- Wireless variant: antenna keep-out at board edge (dimensions TBD from datasheet)\n- M2.5 mounting holes (positions TBD from datasheet)" (at 20 30 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid ebb235ce-f0b8-47ab-a826-bd8fa78e88e3))
  (text "Source rule: every CM5 connection on this sheet must cite RP-008180-DS (CM5 datasheet),\nRP-008182-DS / CM5IO KiCad files, or the Pi 5 schematics. None have been read yet." (at 20 170 0) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top)) (uuid cbfa08cf-8056-4d24-9ac7-32dd961ba393))
